relentless pixel zombies charging from all directions. Aim sharp, shoot fast, and survive.\n{1771815273708088}\n\n\ud83c\udfa5 Gameplay Video 2 \u2013 Survival Hunter Mode\nEndure the chaos and show your Zombie Hunter skills. The longer you last, the higher your score climbs on the board.\n{781851854389742}\n\n\ud83c\udfa5 Gameplay Video 3 \u2013 Pixel Hunter Action\nDive into retro-inspired pixel visuals as a true Zombie Hunter, with immersive VR shooting mechanics for nonstop action.\n{765738352719996}\n", "short_description": "Be the ultimate Zombie Hunter in VR! Survive pixel zombie waves, rack up kills, and fight for the longest survival time."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://tretastudios.com/vr-privacypolicy.php", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "TretaStudios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://tretastudios.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25809451968694378"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304131_1439875863931492_4454229453235326860_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=olevP91vVgEQ7kNvwFo9m15&_nc_oc=Ados29d7pY1d4H_mYlYiMnnlS338fPQX2Mmg